  title: 'La souccah et le loulav', book: 'Lévitique', ch: 23, ref: 'Leviticus 23:40', refFr: 'Lévitique 23, 40', accent: 2, feast: 'Souccot',
  quote: 'And you shall take to you on the first day the fruits of the fairest tree, and branches of palm trees, and boughs of thick trees, and willows of the brook',
